<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Wednesday 105,000-USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Wednesday 105,000-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Wednesday's est receipts 105,000, Wk ago 111,000, and Yr ago 103,000 head. Estimates include generally about 60 percent Carcass Base Hogs. Barrows and gilts were $0.50 to $1.00 lower than mid-session Tuesday. Trade was moderately active for light demand and moderate to heavy offerings. Top $48.50 per cwt.</p>
